# kernel, platform generic-aarch64 or generic-x64
### The AMD (ATI) graphics cards of a PC or of an arm64 server or workstation, as modules: amdgpu and
### radeon for the older ones. They stay out of the initramfs (postbuild.sh): udev loads them from
### the root file system, with their firmware of linux-firmware in /lib/firmware
CONF_FLAGS+=" -m DRM_AMDGPU -m DRM_RADEON"
